      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-02-09_WidnesExaminer_art0111" n="art0111">
        <p>from the Local Government Board (dated the 16th January), sanctioning the re-appointment of Mr. Henry Ashcroft, as inspector of nuisances for the district for one year from the 24th January, 1907, to the 23rd January 1908, inclusive, with a salary at the rate of £l5O per anuum for his services.—The minutes were approved.</p>
