      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-02-09_WidnesExaminer_art0138" n="art0138">
        <head>LITTLE BILLER</head>
        <p>A LITTLE BILLER</p>
        <p>There were three sailors of Bristol City, Who took a boat and went to sea; But, first, with beef and captain's biscuits, And pickled pork, they loaded she.</p>
      </div>
